{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12962","headline":"丙戌岁正月出洛阳书怀 · 独孤及","name":"丙戌岁正月出洛阳书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁衣褐见，受服金马门。\n拟将忠与贞，来酬主人恩。\n天地暂雷雨，洪波生平原。\n穷鳞遂蹭蹬，夙昔事罕存。\n幸逢帝出震，授钺清东藩。\n白日忽再中，万方咸骏奔。\n王风从西来，春光满乾坤。\n蛰虫竞飞动，余亦辞笼樊。\n遭遇思自强，宠辱安足言。\n唯将四方志，廻首谢故园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}